            "detailed_description": "Unravel a thrilling mystery by exploring a strange and twisted mansion, discovering curious clues, interrogating peculiar suspects and solving unique puzzles.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/359510/extras/6eab9cae741b01fa73229fbafa646d1e.poster.avif?t=1771579217\" width=616 height=70 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/359510/extras/6eab9cae741b01fa73229fbafa646d1e.webm?t=1771579217\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/359510/extras/6eab9cae741b01fa73229fbafa646d1e.mp4?t=1771579217\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Freya Fellow has been murdered. The lead suspect? A shadowy figure found looming over her body, wielding a knife. The problem? That suspect... is just a painting.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/359510/extras/74e15d19ea376b995f85ab65fbfb3b22.poster.avif?t=1771579217\" width=616 height=70 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/359510/extras/74e15d19ea376b995f85ab65fbfb3b22.webm?t=1771579217\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/359510/extras/74e15d19ea376b995f85ab65fbfb3b22.mp4?t=1771579217\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Investigate the entirety of Tangle Tower, from the bizarre and eerie gardens, to the cold and ominous crime scene at the very top.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/359510/extras/0a9cb332c5686e64be5b4ea5a2d869bd.poster.avif?t=1771579217\" width=616 